---

<div class="form__message" role="status" aria-live="polite">
  <div class="form__message-block">
    <button type="button" class="message-close-popup" aria-label="Закрыть уведомление">
      <span></span>
      <span></span>
    </button>
    <h2 class="form__message-title">Спасибо!</h2>
    <p class="form__message-text">
      Спасибо, что оставили заявку! Наш эксперт свяжется с вами в течение 15 минут для уточнения всех деталей путешествия.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .form__message {
    opacity: 0;
    visibility: hidden;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
    z-index: 100;
    transition: opacity var(--transition-speed) ease, visibility var(--transition-speed) ease;
    backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
    padding: 15px;
  }

  :global(.form__message.form__message_active) {
    opacity: 1;
    visibility: visible;
  }

  .form__message-block {
    position: relative;
    max-width: 600px;
    width: 100%;
    background-color: #fff;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 60px 40px 40px;
    text-align: center;
    box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
    transform: scale(0.95);
    transition: transform var(--transition-speed) ease;
  }

  :global(.form__message.form__message_active) .form__message-block {
    transform: scale(1);
  }

  @media (max-width: 500px) {
    .form__message-block {
      padding: 45px 20px 30px;
    }
  }

  .message-close-popup {
    position: absolute;
    top: 15px;
    right: 15px;
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    cursor: pointer;
    background: transparent;
    border: none;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .message-close-popup > span {
    position: absolute;
    background: var(--color-btn-hover);
    height: 2px;
    width: 24px;
    border-radius: 1px;
  }

  .message-close-popup > span:first-of-type {
    transform: rotate(45deg);
  }

  .message-close-popup > span:last-of-type {
    transform: rotate(-45deg);
  }

  .form__message-title {
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-btn-active);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .form__message-text {
    margin-top: 20px;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--color-text-main);
  }
</style>
